      "done_when": "The embedded dependency graph shows ELK's layered top-down layout with orthogonal edge routing, not a randomized force layout. Interim floor: client uses ELK-precomputed positions via preset (drop cose-bilkent randomize:true in template-script.ts:15-33) so layout.ts's layered positions survive to screen. Full: read back ELK edge sections and render per pr-viz's 4-piece recipe (endpoint pinning; bend projection with positive=LEFT perpendicular sign; edge-distances:node-position; per-edge LCA offset). Verified with numeric geometry assertions (window.__elk* hooks / Playwright), not just screenshots.",
